# [Project Name] — Tech Debt Ledger [CUSTOMIZE]

> **How to use this file**
> - **Filed automatically** — the Sprint Close Retro routes its tech-debt bucket here as `TD-NNN` rows.
> - **Aged at Sprint Promote** — unaddressed ≥ 3 sprints → re-review prompt; `severity: high` →
>   auto-escalate to `TODO.md` Backlog P1.
> - **Never deleted** — resolved debt is marked `status: resolved → TASK-NNN` for the audit trail;
>   a row resolved ≥ 3 sprints ago collapses to one line in § Resolved (§11).
> - IDs use the `TD-NNN` namespace (separate from `TASK-NNN`); ids are monotonic, never reused.
> - `severity` ∈ trivial · minor · medium · high

